.cache/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv/
venv/

.claude/settings.local.json

# Machine state — every file one machine and one run write for the gates: the overseer's
# recursion guards, the continue counter, the supervision mode, the complexity budgets,
# the unattended supervisor's state, cost, heartbeat, logs and archive. Written by hooks and
# scripts, never by agent tools. One directory, so one line (package 3c).
.claude/state/

# What the agent produces while working is tracked under .engine/ — except PROGRESS.md, a
# per-run working log (the audit scenarios lay their own fixture there).
.engine/PROGRESS.md
HANDOFF-*.md
# Claude Code's own parallel-session checkouts (claude --worktree).
.claude/worktrees/
